~ start
Wendy: Danilo... thank goodness. What happened to you?
Danilo: . . . . .
Danilo: It’s all my fault... I don’t deserve to live...
Wendy: Don’t say that, Danilo...
Danilo: [shake]Everything that happened to Mateo... it was because of me.[/shake]
Danilo: [shake]If I hadn’t left him... maybe he’d still be alive.[/shake]
Danilo: Every day, I still hear him...
Danilo: “Help me.” Over and over again.
Danilo: No matter what I do... it doesn’t stop.
Danilo: [shake]He doesn’t stop![/shake]
Wendy: Danilo, please...
Danilo: But it’s too late, isn’t it? It’s all too late.
Danilo: I can’t take it anymore, Wendy...
Danilo: [shake]I don’t want to hear it anymore... I don’t want to remember...[/shake]
Danilo: [shake]I don’t want to feel anything anymore...[/shake]
=> END
